---
// Parallax: dusk over the Glass House Mountains, north of Brisbane.
// Back to front: sky, stars, setting sun, the mountains, the D'Aguilar
// range, low hills, and a line of gum trees. Each layer has its own
// travel distance; theme.css (or script.ts as a fallback) moves the
// layers up at different speeds during the first screen of scroll.
// The parent .theme-decor is aria-hidden and ignores pointer events.
---

